>’에 <ruby>思念<rt>수ˉ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì kâm-jāi-gùn tùi-lì’e sū-liām\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>希望<rt>히ˉ빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>仝款<rt>강콴ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>夢<rt>빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hī-bang-lì u-kang-khoàn’e bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>란<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>兩人<rt>능랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>做陣<rt>죄ˋ딘ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>轉<rt>등ˋ</rt></ruby>’래 <ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一工<rt>짇강ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lân-nng-láng joè-tīn tǹg’lai hît-jit-kâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>互相<rt>허셩ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>依倚<rt>이ˉ와ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>情愛<rt>졩애</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hor-siōng-ī-oà’e jieng-ai\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心肝<rt>심ˉ괄ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>內<rt>래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ti-lì’e sīm-koā̰-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>存在<rt>준재ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-m-si-kôh-u-goà’e jun-jāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>等<rt>단ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    yêng-oân-lông-lêh-tàn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>時陣<rt>시준ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>甘願<rt>감ˉ꽌ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-si-jūn ma-e-m-kām-goān\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>做伙<rt>조ˋ훼ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>飛<rt>붸ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-kông-bêh-jò-huê-puê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>去<rt>킈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一个<rt>짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby>心中<rt>심ˉ뎡ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>美麗<rt>삐ˆ레ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>所在<rt>서ˆ재ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khì-jit-e-sīm-tiōng-bî-lē’e sôr-jāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>所有<rt>서ˆ우ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>一切<rt>읻ˆ체</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sôr-ū’e ît-che\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>總<rt>정ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>囥<rt>킁ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>做伙<rt>조ˋ훼ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lông-jòng kâh-lì khǹg-jò-huè\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>希望<rt>히ˉ빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會當<rt>에당ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>了解<rt>ᄅᆤˆ개ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hī-bang-lì e-tàng-liâu-kài\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>今仔日<rt>긴ˉ아ˆ띧ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>月娘<rt>뀋뉴ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>遐邇<rt>햫ˆ니</rt></ruby><ruby>光<rt>긍ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kīn-â-rît gueh-niú nà hiâh-ni-kn̂g\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>照<rt>죠ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>規暝<rt>귀ˉ미ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>當<rt>당ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>睏<rt>쿤</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span cla