에 <ruby>存在<rt>준재ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-m-si-kôh-u-goà’e jun-jāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>等<rt>단ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    yêng-oân-lông-lêh-tàn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>時陣<rt>시준ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>甘願<rt>감ˉ꽌ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-si-jūn ma-e-m-kām-goān\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>做伙<rt>조ˋ훼ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>飛<rt>붸ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-kông-bêh-jò-huê-puê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>去<rt>킈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一个<rt>짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby>心中<rt>심ˉ뎡ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>美麗<rt>삐ˆ레ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>所在<rt>서ˆ재ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khì-jit-e-sīm-tiōng-bî-lē’e sôr-jāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>所有<rt>서ˆ우ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>一切<rt>읻ˆ체</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sôr-ū’e ît-che\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>總<rt>정ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>囥<rt>킁ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>做伙<rt>조ˋ훼ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lông-jòng kâh-lì khǹg-jò-huè\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>希望<rt>히ˉ빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會當<rt>에당ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>了解<rt>ᄅᆤˆ개ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hī-bang-lì e-tàng-liâu-kài\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>管<rt>관ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄-</rt></ruby><ruby>時間<rt>시간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄-</rt></ruby><ruby>目滓<rt>빡새ˋ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a> <ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄-</rt></ruby><ruby>失望<rt>싣ˆ뻥ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>忍耐<rt>띰ˆ내ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà m-koân-roa-joe-si-kân roa-joe-bak-sài roa-joe-sît-bōng lai-rîm-nāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"koân\">管<rt>관ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>當時<rt>당ˉ시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"tǹg’lai\">轉’래<rt>등ˋ’래</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà m-koân-lì tāng-sí e-tǹg’lai\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>其實<rt>기싣-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知影<rt>재ˉ얄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為怎樣<rt>위좔ˆ율ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>為怎樣<rt>위좔ˆ율ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>慐慐<rt>껑껑-</rt></ruby><ruby>等待<rt>단ˆ태ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ki-sit-goà ma-m-jāi-yà̰ wi-joâ̰-yṵ̄ wi-joâ̰-yṵ̄ gong-gong-tân-thāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>唯一<rt>위읻</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"ai\">愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì si-goâ-wi-it’e ai\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心肝<rt>심ˉ괄ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>內<rt>래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ti-lì’e sīm-koā̰-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>存在<rt>준재ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-m-si-kôh-u-goà’e jun-jāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>等<rt>단ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    yêng-oân-lông-lêh-tàn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>時陣<rt>시준ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>甘願<rt>감ˉ꽌ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-si-jūn ma-e-m-kām-goān\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>做伙<rt>조ˋ훼ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>飛<rt>붸ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-kông-bêh-jò-huê-puê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>去<rt>킈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一个<rt>짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby>心中<rt>심ˉ뎡ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>美麗<rt>삐ˆ레ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>所在<rt>서ˆ재ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khì-jit-e-sīm-tiōng-bî-lē’e sôr-jāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>所有<rt>서ˆ우ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>一切<rt>읻ˆ체</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sôr-ū’e ît-che\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>總<rt>정ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>囥<rt>킁ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>做伙<rt>조ˋ훼ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lông-jòng kâh-lì khǹg-jò-huè\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>希望<rt>히ˉ빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會當<rt>에당ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>了解<rt>ᄅᆤˆ개ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hī-bang-lì e-tàng-liâu-kài\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一定<rt>읻ˆ뎽-</rt></ruby><ruby>等<rt>단ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wi-tioh-lì goà ît-tieng-tàn\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<table class=\"wp-block-table alignleft\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;border: none;font-size: 16px\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td style=\"border: none;vertical-align: top;min-width: 5em;padding-right: 1.5em;padding-left: 0;padding-top: 0;padding-bottom: 0\">\n  <a href=\"#_ftnref1\" id=\"_ftn1\">¹</a>\n  <i>\n    <span><ruby title=\"bak-sài\">目滓<rt>빡새ˋ</rt></ruby></span>\n  </i> :\n</td>\n    <td style=\"border: none;padding: 0\">\n      (中) 眼淚（俗字寫作「目屎」）。<br>\n      (en) Tears.\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<div style=\"clear: both;margin-bottom: 1em\"></div>\n"
